## Success Criteria

1. **Pixel-perfect match**: ZERO visual differences from Figma
2. **All breakpoints verified**: Mobile (375px), Tablet (768px), Desktop (1280px)
3. **Out-of-scope reported**: Any non-styling issues clearly documented
4. **Workspace cleaned**: All test-*.js and *.png files removed

## Fail-Fast Protocol (2-Minute Limit)

If Playwright or authentication fails after TWO attempts → **STOP IMMEDIATELY** and report with FULL error output.

